Cray zmqnet <VERSION>:
======================================

Release Date:
--------------
  <RELEASE_DATE>


Product Description:
--------------------
  zmqnet is a library for creating a network tree between applications
  and HPC jobs using zmq.

Changelog:
---------
[ MANUAL_RELEASE_HISTORY ]
[ AUTO_RELEASE_HISTORY ]

=======================================================================
## [1.0.0] - 2022-9-26   (22.10)
=======================================================================

* Initial release

Product and OS Dependencies:
-----------------------------
  The Cray zmqnet <VERSION> release is supported on the following Cray systems:
    - HPE/Cray XC systems with CLE 7.0 or later
    - HPE/Cray CS systems with CentOS/RH 8.4 or later
    - HPE/Cray Shasta systems with SLES 15 service pack 2 or later
    - HPE Apollo systems with Slurm and RH 8.6 or later
    - Baymax systems with RH 8.4 or later

  Product Dependencies:
    - Cray cray-cti rpm installed
    - Cray cray-cdst-support rpm installed

Documentation:
---------------

Installation instructions:
--------------------------

   Installation instructions for <DIST>:
   =============================================
      rpm -ivh cray-zmqnet-<VERSION>-<RELEASE>.<ARCH>.rpm

      To make Cray zmqnet <VERSION> the default version of cray-zmqnet, execute:
      /opt/cray/admin-pe/set_default_files/set_default_cray-zmqnet-<VERSION>


